the heat on Congress."

00:29:12.183 --> 00:29:13.618
Well what that meant was,

00:29:13.618 --> 00:29:16.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
you had to have a program
like three tax cuts

00:29:16.554 --> 00:29:18.089
