00:29:19.491 --> 00:29:22.427 align:start size:97% position:3%
that the American people would
say to their congressmen.

00:29:22.427 --> 00:29:24.696
I really want you to pass this.

00:29:24.696 --> 00:29:26.498 align:start size:84% position:16%
And I've been
arguing for example,

00:29:26.498 --> 00:29:28.800 align:start size:88% position:13%
that the administration
should come out for

00:29:28.800 --> 00:29:33.805
